  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamakali khu biianwa bibiama khu Roho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Busiime nibwo mukhoyeele muyiime. Ra kimiooyo kienywe khu biianwa bia Roho, ne lukali siianwa sie khung'oola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu olomaloma mu nimi chingeni salomaloma khu baandu tawe, ne kakhali khu Wele, se aliio yesi yesi omuulila tawe. Alikho alomaloma bung'ali bwe mu bwikisi mu bunyali bwa Roho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oyo ong'oola alomaloma khu baandu ne khubaelesia buyeeti, abaraamo kumwoyo ne khubaoleelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo olomalomanga mu nimi chingeni eyombakhanga omwene, ne oyo ong'oola ayeetanga e kanisa yoosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikoomba ndi andi mweesi mulomaloma mu nimi chingeni, ne kakhali nenya lukali po ndi andi mwanyoolile siianwa sie khung'oola. Sikila ong'oola ali owe bukhala bukali khukhila oyo olomalomanga mu nimi chingeni, omundu akhoyeele abeo onyala aakaluukhasia niko alomaloma, nio e Kanisa yoosi enyoole buyeeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase, nono ne nicha khwinywe, ndaba owa buyeeti siina ne ndomaloma mu nimi chingeni? Se ndabakho owe buyeeti bwosi bwosi khwinywe, nekhamureerere lifuunulwa khukhwama khu Wele namwe bukesi namwe bung'oosi namwe liliekisia tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukula bibiindu biikhalimo bulamu bibiipanga kimienya nga kumulele, namwe lituungu, omundu yesi yesi amanya ariena kumwenya kulikho ne kupwa liaba bali se bikubuula bulayi tawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu oupa ekhoombi aba bali se akiipa bulayi tawe, naanu okherekekhele liie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngila ng'eneyo, omundu yesi alamanyilisia ariena niko mulikho mulomalomakho, ne kaaba bali burume bwenywe nibwo muaana mu nimi chingeni se buuliilikha bulayi tawe? Kamakhuwa kenywe kalatibila mu mbeo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinomo chingali chichabukhana chili mu sibala, ne kakhali se luliio lukhalimo nende nisio lwekesia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne naaba nekhamanyile lulomo lulikho ne lulomwa tawe, omundu olurumikhira alaba omukeni khwise ne ese ndaba omukeni khu niye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila muli ne silukuluku khunyoola biianwa bia Roho, khukhwola mukhake khutuuma bibiindu bioosi khurumikhira bulayi biianwa biyeeta khukhwombakha e Kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, omundu olomaloma mu nimi chingeni khukhwola asabe khulwe siianwa sie khukaluukhasia niko alomaloome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne naaba ne saba mu lulimi luno, ng'ali roho wase asaba ne kamebaasio kase se kali siimbi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono ese khole ndiena? Ndasaba ne roho wase, lundi ndasaba akhaba ne kamebaasio kaase, ndemba ne roho wase, lundi nimbe ne kamebaasio kase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mupila Wele orio mu roho mwong'ene kanyalikha kariena omundu, okundi oli mwibukaana alome ali “Amina” mu lisaba lienywe lie khu khupa orio? Se ali ne ngila eye khumanya niko mulikho mulomaloma tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba lisaba lienywe lie khu khupila Wele orio ne lili lilayi, omundu okundi oyo se anyoolakho buyeeti na akeekhe ene tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese khupila Wele orio sikila ndomalomanga mu nimi chingeni khumukhila enywe mweesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mubukaana mu Kanisa bwakhabeele bulayi ndomalome kamakhuwa karaano kanyala khuulilwa, nio nyale khukhwikisia babaandi, khukhila khulomaloma kamakhuwa chielefu mu nimi chingeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase, mukhaba nga babaana mu libaasia lienywe tawe. Ba nga babaana mu khuba aleeyi khukhwama khu bwoni, lundi ba bakhulu mu mebaasio kenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.11+ISA.28.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 28.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Liaandikwa mu maandiko bali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako siianwa sie khulomaloma mu nimi chingeni sili buloli khu bakhasuubila tawe, se sili khu basuubila tawe, ne siianwa sie khung'oola sili sisiekesia khu babasuubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba nono, bali e Kanisa yoosi yakaanana ne buli mundu arakikha khulomaloma mu nimi chingeni, ne kaaba bali omundu busa namwe okhasuubila tawe, echamo, se alaloma ali mweesi mwakwile ne kamalalu tawe ku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali buli mundu aaba ne alikho ang'oola mala okhasuubila tawe, namwe omundu okhamanyile siindu tawe echamo, alaboolelwa bubwoni bwewe khubirira mu niko aulila. Alakhalakilwa khubirira mu koosi niko aulila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kamebaasio kewe ke mu bwikisi kalamanyikhana, khwako alasikama mala asaaye Wele alome ali, “Ng'ali Wele ali ano mwinywe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liiba mu Kanisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase, kano kali niko mboola. Ne mwakaanana mwibukaana, omundu mulala ali ne kumwenya, okundi liliekisia, okundi lifunulwa khukhwama khu Wele, okundi burume mu nimi chingeni, okundi khukaluukhasia kalomilwe. Buli siindu khukhwola sibe sie buyeeti khu kanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu aaba ne alikho acha khulomaloma mu nimi chingeni, bakhoyeele balomaloma babili namwe bataru bong'ene, mulala sia mulala, ne omundu okundi akhoyeele akaluukhasie kalikho ne kalomwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba bali se aliio onyala akaluukhasia tawe, oyo olomaloma mu nimi chingeni khukhwola asile busa mala omwene alomalome khu Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babili namwe bataru banyoolile burume bwa Wele bakhoyeele balomalome, ne babaandi nabo baloleelesie niko abo balikho ne baloma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaaba bali omundu owikhaale mu libukaana anyoola burume khukhwama khu Wele, oyo olikho ne alomaloma akhoyeele asile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mweesi munyala khung'oola mulala sia mulala, nio buli mundu eyike ne khuraamwo kumwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siianwa sie khung'oola khukhwola sibe mu bunyali bwo mundu olikho ng'oola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Wele se ali Wele owe likoyaano tawe, ne kakhali ali Wele we kumuleembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga kabechaanga mu chikanisa choosi che babaandu ba Wele, bakhasi bakhoyeele basila busa ne bali mwibukaana. Se bafukiililwa khulomaloma tawe, nga Lilaka lie Bayaudi liboola, khukhwola bakhaba mu bwimeelesi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne benya khumanya sisiindu, bakhoyeele bareebe baseecha babwe engo, sili sisiindu sie chisoni khu mukhasi khulomalomela mu Kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eku, mwibaasia muli elomo eya Wele yama mwinywe? Namwe enywe mweng'ene nibo yechamo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi yesi ne ebukula khuuba omung'oosi, namwe ali ali ne siianwa sia Roho, khukhwola amanye ali niko muandikila kano kali lilaka lio Mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu nakharekeeresia khu kano tawe, mukhamurekeeresia niye tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase, nono, yekoomba lukali khung'oola, lundi mukhakaania khulomalomela mu nimi chingeni tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli siindu khukhwola sikholelwe mu ngila endayi lundi eye lirekekha lilayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
